    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just not just a \"small step\" thing though. it's like every time i try to fix it, the universe just finds a way to pull me back down. it's relentless. it feels like this cycle of failing and feeling like trash is just my reality now. i'm so just... done with fighting it. i'm just so tired of the struggle.",
